{"at": "2026-11-25T11:17:38.385Z", "run": "20261125-0107-research-compute-5c82", "unit": "u63", "op": "confirm", "rid": "compute/xai-grok-api", "path": "$.verified_at", "old": "2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z", "new": "2026-11-25T11:17:38.368Z", "rung": "reported", "evidence": {"url": "https://walterpinem.com/grok-xai-api/", "date": "2026-11-25", "proved": "the page states that there is no free API tier and no free credits for new accounts, and that the only way to get credit without paying is a promo code; the 2024 beta credit is ended", "capture": "sha256:49c3763c1d28ebe53dabd43fab089a13b22d07fa7273fbbf6f9b0d88967e09df", "quote": "The xAI API has no free tier and gives new accounts no free credits. xAI’s billing documentation covers prepaid credits, auto top-up, invoiced billing, and promo codes. The $25 a month in credits from the public beta ended on December 31, 2024, so a promo code redeemed under API spend management in the console is the only way to get credit without paying."}, "added": true, "reason": "$.free_tier.stated", "unread": ["identity_cost", "egress", "interface", "limits", "per_object_cap", "retention", "tooling", "chaining", "reliability_note", "notes", "binding", "binding_note", "free_tier.unit", "free_tier.metered_on"]}
